# 行尾策略：仓库内统一 LF，工作区不因工具/平台而变。
#
# 为什么需要（2026-10-08 事故）：本仓库 core.autocrlf=false，git 按字节
# 比较。曾出现「用脚本改 1 行 → 整个 2985 行文件被转成 CRLF → diff 显示
# 3006 增/2985 删」的真实 diff 噪音（真实改动仅 +73/-52），review 失效、
# git blame 全部指到最后一次改动、merge 按行而非按内容冲突。
#
# `text=auto eol=lf`：git 视文本为文本，且**工作区也强制 LF**。这让
# 「工作区被工具转成 CRLF」不再发生——git 检出时即已归一化。

* text=auto eol=lf

# ── 明确标为二进制：禁止任何行尾/文本转换，也禁止 diff ──
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.eot    binary
*.mp3    binary
*.wav    binary
*.mp4    binary
*.webm   binary
*.pdf    binary
*.zip    binary
*.gz     binary
*.7z     binary
*.exe    binary
*.dll    binary
*.so     binary
*.dylib  binary
*.node   binary
*.wasm   binary
*.db     binary
*.sqlite binary
*.pack   binary
*.idx    binary
*.pdf    binary

